 "stimulus_html": "The given figure is the graph of <span data-math=\"y = x + 2\">y = x + 2</span>.\n<br>\n<figure>\n<figcaption>Graph of <span data-math=\"y = x + 2\">y = x + 2</span></figcaption>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/665f0de0ccd0bc97.jpg\" alt=\"A line is plotted on an x y coordinate plane. The x and y axes range from negative 8 to 8, in increments of 1. The line passes through the following points, (negative 7, negative 5), (negative 2, 0), (0, 2), and (5, 7).\">\n</figure>\nFor each ordered pair below, decide:\n<br>\n<ol type=\"I\">\n<li>Is the ordered pair a solution to the equation?</li>\n<li>Is the point on the line?</li></ol>",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 508218,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
