     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"y = x + 2\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"(0, 2)\"></span></p>\n<p>Is the ordered pair a solution to the equation?</p>\n<p>Substitute the pair into the equation.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"2 = 0 + 2\"></span></p>\n<p>This is true, so the ordered pair is a solution.</p>\n<p>Is the point on the line?</p>\n<p>Yes. If the ordered pair is a solution to the equation, then the ordered pair is a point on the line.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<br>\n<ol type=\"I\">\n<li>Yes</li> \n<li>Yes</li>\n</ol>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
