     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"(1, 2)\"></span></p>\n<p>Is the ordered pair a solution to the equation? Substitute the pair into the equation.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"2 = 1 + 2\"></span></p>\n<p>This is not true, so the ordered pair is not a solution.</p>\n<p>Is the point on the line?</p>\n<p>No. If the ordered pair is not a solution to the equation, then the ordered pair is not a point on the line.</p>"
